#: {{uxi|ru|[[молодо́й]] '''ме́сяц'''|new '''moon'''}}

====Usage notes====
Stress shift to the ending is standard in {{m|ru|[[по]] '''месяца́м'''}} and {{m|ru|'''[[месяца́ми]]'''|t=for months}}, but this has led to occasional non-standard use of the full stress pattern with final stress in all plural forms and an -а ending in the nominative/accusative plural (see {{m|ru|го́род}}).

